<view class="create-family-container data-v-54df8ede"><view class="nav-bar data-v-54df8ede"><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['goBack',['$event']]]]]}}" class="back-btn data-v-54df8ede" bindtap="__e"><text class="back-icon data-v-54df8ede">←</text></view><text class="nav-title data-v-54df8ede">创建家庭</text></view><view class="content data-v-54df8ede"><view class="form-card data-v-54df8ede"><view class="input-group data-v-54df8ede"><text class="input-label data-v-54df8ede">家庭名称</text><input class="input-field data-v-54df8ede" placeholder="为您的家取个雅致的名字" placeholder-style="color: #D2B48C" data-event-opts="{{[['input',[['__set_model',['','familyName','$event',[]]]]]]}}" value="{{familyName}}" bindinput="__e"/><text class="input-hint data-v-54df8ede">例：温馨小居、雅致书房、清风明月居</text></view><view class="input-group data-v-54df8ede"><text class="input-label data-v-54df8ede">家庭地址</text><input class="input-field data-v-54df8ede" placeholder="请输入家庭地址" placeholder-style="color: #D2B48C" data-event-opts="{{[['input',[['__set_model',['','familyAddress','$event',[]]]]]]}}" value="{{familyAddress}}" bindinput="__e"/></view><view class="input-group data-v-54df8ede"><text class="input-label data-v-54df8ede">家庭简介</text><textarea class="textarea-field data-v-54df8ede" placeholder="用诗意的语言描述您的家..." placeholder-style="color: #D2B48C" maxlength="100" data-event-opts="{{[['input',[['__set_model',['','familyDesc','$event',[]]]]]]}}" value="{{familyDesc}}" bindinput="__e"></textarea><text class="char-count data-v-54df8ede">{{$root.g0+"/100"}}</text></view><view class="template-section data-v-54df8ede"><text class="section-title data-v-54df8ede">选择家庭模板</text><view class="template-grid data-v-54df8ede"><block wx:for="{{templates}}" wx:for-item="template" wx:for-index="__i0__" wx:key="id"><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['e0',['$event']]]]]}}" data-event-params="{{({template})}}" class="{{['template-card','data-v-54df8ede',(selectedTemplate===template.id)?'active':'']}}" bindtap="__e"><text class="template-icon data-v-54df8ede">{{template.icon}}</text><text class="template-name data-v-54df8ede">{{template.name}}</text></view></block></view></view></view><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['createFamily',['$event']]]]]}}" class="create-btn data-v-54df8ede" bindtap="__e"><text class="btn-text data-v-54df8ede">创建家庭</text></view><view class="poem-section data-v-54df8ede"><text class="poem-text data-v-54df8ede">「 家是心灵的港湾，是温暖的归宿 」</text></view></view></view>